; fit_content is deliberately off. It makes the label's minimum height the height of all its text,
; and this one holds the CLI's full conflict message — which is as long as the conflict is
; complicated. An AcceptDialog grows to its contents' minimum, so fit_content here means the dialog's
; height is dictated by the worst error it ever shows. It scrolls instead.

